    SHIFT  boost

    HOLD F  warp (when unlocked)

    ESC  free the mouse'
  footControlsText: 'MOUSE  look

    W A S D  move

    SHIFT  sprint

    SPACE  jump

    E  interact

    ESC  free the mouse'
